---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f5ef"/><meta name="description" content="万象漫游 MÖBIUS：转动地球，从国家到县城，探索自然奇观与人类文明。"/><title>万象漫游 MÖBIUS — 每一寸土地，都有故事</title><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
 <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="万象漫游首页"><span class="brand-symbol">∞</span><span><b>MÖBIUS</b><small>万 象 漫 游</small></span></a>
 <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="主导航"><button class="nav-link active" data-nav="explore">探索地球<span></span></button><button class="nav-link" data-nav="heritage">文化图鉴</button><button class="nav-link" data-nav="routes">灵感路线</button><button class="nav-link" data-nav="saved">我的收藏 <em id="saved-count">0</em></button></nav>
 <div class="header-actions"><button class="search-trigger" id="search-open" aria-label="搜索目的地"><i data-lucide="search"></i><span>寻找你的下一站</span><kbd>⌘ K</kbd></button><span class="header-divider"></span><button id="about-open" class="round-button profile" aria-label="使用指南"><i data-lucide="compass"></i></button></div>
</header>
<main>
 <section class="explorer" id="explorer">
  <div class="intro" id="intro"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-orbit"></span>A WORLD OF WONDERS</div><h1>世界很大，<br/>好奇心<span class="heading-dot">不设限。</span></h1><p class="intro-text">转动地球，遇见山河与文明。<br/>从遥远的国度，到藏着故事的小城，<br/>让每一次探索，都成为一场文化旅行。</p><button class="primary-button" id="start-explore">开启我的探索 <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></button><button class="catalog-entry" id="catalog-open">浏览全球文化图鉴 <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></button><div class="intro-note"><span class="mini-line"></span>不止于抵达，更在于发现。</div><div class="discovery-types"><span><i data-lucide="landmark"></i>人文遗产</span><span><i data-lucide="mountain"></i>自然奇观</span><span><i data-lucide="sparkles"></i>在地文化</span></div></div>
  <div class="region-intro hidden" id="region-intro"><button class="back-button" id="back-region"><i data-lucide="arrow-left"></i> 返回上一级</button><div class="eyebrow" id="region-en">CHINA · 中国</div><h1 id="region-title">中国</h1><p id="region-description"></p><div class="region-meta" id="region-meta"></div><input class="region-search hidden" id="region-search" placeholder="筛选下级行政区…" aria-label="筛选下级行政区"/><div class="region-children" id="region-children"></div><div class="region-status" id="region-status" role="status"></div><p class="region-hint"><i data-lucide="mouse-pointer-2"></i> 点击地图上的区域，继续深入探索</p></div>
  <div class="map-stage" id="map-stage"><div class="map-aura"></div><div class="orbital orbital-one"></div><div class="orbital orbital-two"></div><span class="orbit-caption">EVERY PLACE HAS A STORY</span><div id="globe" aria-label="可拖动旋转的3D地球地图"></div><div id="map-labels"></div><div id="loading" class="map-loading"><span></span> 正在展开世界…</div><div class="map-breadcrumb" id="breadcrumb"><button data-depth="0"><i data-lucide="globe-2"></i> 地球</button><span class="crumb-detail"> / 自由探索</span></div><div class="globe-caption" id="globe-caption"><span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE EXPLORATION <span class="coordinates">正在定位</span></div><aside id="poi-panel" class="poi-panel hidden" aria-label="本区景点清单"><button id="poi-panel-toggle" class="poi-panel-toggle" aria-expanded="true"><span><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i> 本区 <b id="poi-map-count">0</b> 处景点</span><span>⌄</span></button><div class="poi-panel-body"><div id="poi-list"></div><button id="poi-more">浏览全部景点 ↗</button><button id="poi-load">＋ 补充当地景点</button><small id="poi-status" role="status"></small><div class="poi-legend"><span>▥ 博物馆</span><span>♜ 古迹</span><span>◆ 地标</span><span>♧ 公园</span></div></div></aside><div class="terrain-tag"><span class="terrain-bars">▂▄▆</span> 3D 地形视图</div></div>
  <div class="map-tools"><button id="reset-view" aria-label="重置地图视角" title="重置视角"><i data-lucide="locate-fixed"></i></button><div class="tool-group"><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="放大地图"><i data-lucide="plus"></i></button><span></span><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="缩小地图"><i data-lucide="minus"></i></button></div><button id="auto-rotate" class="selected" aria-label="切换自动旋转" title="自动旋转"><i data-lucide="orbit"></i></button><button id="fullscreen" aria-label="全屏探索"><i data-lucide="expand"></i></button></div>
  <div class="compass-rose"><span>N</span><i></i><small>S</small></div>
  <div class="map-instructions"><i data-lucide="mouse"></i><span>拖动旋转</span><b>·</b><span>滚轮缩放</span><b>·</b><span>点击目的地探索</span></div>
 </section>
 <div class="coverage-strip"><span><i data-lucide="globe-2"></i><b id="coverage-countries">—</b> 个国家和地区提供下级边界</span><span><i data-lucide="landmark"></i><b id="coverage-places">—</b> 处景点与地标</span><span><i data-lucide="box"></i><b id="coverage-models">—</b> 个精细模型</span><button id="coverage-open">查看实际覆盖 <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></button></div><section class="discover-section" id="discover"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">FOLLOW YOUR CURIOSITY</span><h2 id="discover-title">下一站，心之所向<span>精选值得慢慢探索的地方</span></h2></div><div class="filter-tabs" role="group" aria-label="景点分类"><button data-filter="all" class="active">全部灵感</button><button data-filter="culture">人文古迹</button><button data-filter="nature">自然奇观</button><button data-filter="museum">博物馆</button><button data-filter="landmark">城市地标</button><button data-filter="park">公园花园</button><button data-filter="mixed">双重遗产</button></div><div class="carousel-arrows"><button id="cards-prev" aria-label="向左浏览"><i data-lucide="arrow-left"></i></button><button id="cards-next" aria-label="向右浏览"><i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></button></div></div><div id="city-shortcuts" class="city-shortcuts"></div><div class="catalog-toolbar hidden" id="catalog-toolbar"><label class="catalog-search"><i data-lucide="search"></i><input id="catalog-query" placeholder="搜索景点、地标、城市…" aria-label="筛选全球景点"/></label><select id="catalog-country" aria-label="按国家筛选"><option value="">全部国家与地区</option></select><label class="model-filter"><input type="checkbox" id="catalog-models"/> 精细 3D 模型</label><span id="catalog-count" role="status"></span></div><div class="place-grid" id="place-grid"></div><button class="load-more hidden" id="load-more">查看更多文化图鉴 <i data-lucide="arrow-down"></i></button><div id="empty-state" class="hidden empty-state">这里还没有收藏。点击景点卡片上的书签，留住你的心动目的地。</div></section>
 <footer><span>© 2026 MÖBIUS 万象漫游</span><span class="footer-motto">以好奇为经，以文化为纬。</span><button id="data-info">地图与内容说明 <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></button></footer>
</main>
<div id="toast" role="status"></div>
<dialog id="search-dialog" class="search-dialog"><form method="dialog"><div class="search-input-wrap"><i data-lucide="search"></i><input id="search-input" placeholder="搜索国家、城市或文化景点…" autocomplete="off"/><button aria-label="关闭搜索">ESC</button></div></form><div id="search-results"></div><div class="search-footer">让好奇心，带你去远方。 <span>↵ 选择目的地</span></div></dialog>
<dialog id="detail-dialog" class="detail-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" id="detail-close" aria-label="关闭详情"><i data-lucide="x"></i></button><div class="detail-visual"><img id="detail-image" alt=""/><div class="detail-image-shade"></div><span class="detail-visual-tag"><i data-lucide="scan"></i> 沉浸式文化图鉴</span><div id="detail-model" class="hidden"></div><div class="model-views hidden" id="model-views"><button data-view="photo" class="active">实景</button><button data-view="detailed">精细模型</button><button data-view="local">建筑意象</button></div><button id="model-toggle"><i data-lucide="box"></i><span>查看 3D 意象</span></button><div class="detail-visual-title"><span id="detail-en"></span><h2 id="detail-name"></h2><p id="detail-location"></p></div></div><div class="detail-copy"><div class="detail-topline"><span id="detail-badge"></span><button id="detail-save"><i data-lucide="bookmark"></i> 收藏目的地</button></div><h3 id="detail-tagline"></h3><p id="detail-description"></p><p id="encyclopedia-status" class="encyclopedia-status" role="status"></p><a id="encyclopedia-source" class="encyclopedia-source hidden" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a><div class="detail-facts" id="detail-facts"></div><h4>值得细看的风景</h4><p id="detail-story"></p><p class="photo-credit" id="photo-credit"></p><div class="model-provenance hidden" id="model-provenance"></div><div class="detail-source"><i data-lucide="book-open"></i><span>继续阅读权威介绍 <a id="detail-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UNESCO 世界遗产中心 ↗</a></span></div><button id="detail-locate" class="primary-button">在地图中探索 <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></button></div></dialog>
<dialog id="info-dialog" class="info-dialog"><button id="info-close" class="dialog-close" aria-label="关闭"><i data-lucide="x"></i></button><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE GUIDE TO WANDERING</div><h2 id="info-title">世界，等你慢慢展开。</h2><div id="info-content"></div></dialog>
<script>import '../scripts/app';</script>
</body></html>
